WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.234
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:04.267
You're here. You made it.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:06.901
Thank you.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:08.267
Well, let's get to
some news here.

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.501
Well, guys, this weekend,
former president Trump

00:00:10.501 --> 00:00:12.033
closed out CPAC.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:13.701
And at one point
during his speech,

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.400
he made some
pretty intense promises.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.400
Watch this.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:19.300
-Today, I add,
I am your warrior,

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.701
I am your justice,
and for those who have been

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:26.334
wronged and betrayed,
I am your retribution.

00:00:26.334 --> 00:00:28.234
I am your retribution.

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:31.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.934
-He's either running for
president or auditioning to be

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.200
the next John Wick.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.968
He was like,
"I'm your retribution."

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:40.434
Then he kind of went
off the rails after that.

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:43.100
He's like,
"I'm the captain now.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.701
I am the one who knocks.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:49.234
I am the walrus.
Coo-coo-ca-choo."

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:52.133
Yep, Trump was the headliner
for the four-day event,

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:53.133
but it didn't look like
too many people

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.367
showed up for his speech.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.834
Check out this shot
of the room that it was...

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.300
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.000
There's more people seated
at LaGuardia

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.667
for flights to Moscow right now.

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.334
It was so empty, the guy
started vacuuming because

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:08.501
he thought the event was over.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.734
He's like, "No, no, he's..."

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:13.567
But Trump spoke
for almost two hours.

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.501
And, of course,
he had a few slip-ups.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:16.934
But listen to this.

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:20.334
-...who is presiding over one of
the most dangerous and violent

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:22.834
cities in the United Straights.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:24.834
You have to see this.
United States.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:29.667
-Yeah, United Straits. Yeah.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.033
Mike Pence heard
"United Straights"

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:33.334
and was like, "Hey,
that's my campaign slogan."

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.634 --> 00:01:38.801
Thank you.
-Yeah, come on!

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:40.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.934 --> 00:01:43.901
-How do you mispronounce a word
that's in the job title

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.467
you're trying to get?

00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:47.033
That's like going to
a job interview and like,

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:49.133
"I would make a great barista
here at Storebucks.

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:51.067
I would really..."

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:53.100
Yeah, that word was
giving Trump a lot of trouble,

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.601
'cause later in his speech,
he had a similar gaffe.

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:55.968
Watch this.

00:01:55.968 --> 00:02:00.100
-And I'll challenge the
governors of all 50 spates --

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:01.634
all 50 states.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:06.601
-"50 spates. All 50 spates.

00:02:06.601 --> 00:02:09.601
From Pennessee
to New Ham Sandwich."

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:13.334
That's right -- Trump was the --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:15.601
Trump was the headliner at CPAC.

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.634
It was a big speech,
so his staff tried to keep him

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:20.400
on message by making him
use a teleprompter.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.734
Yeah, so check out what
they were showing him

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:23.133
to keep him focused.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:24.434
-Thank you very much.

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:28.200
And I'm thrilled to be back
at CPAC with thousands of

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.834
great and true
American patriots.

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:34.434
We shut down the illegal
foreign invasion at our borders.

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:36.934
We deported
illegal criminal aliens.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.834
I built hundreds of miles
of wall.

00:02:39.834 --> 00:02:42.033
We're going to do another
200 miles of wall.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:44.701
Under my leadership,
we will seal it up.

00:02:44.701 --> 00:02:48.033
I will stop Joe Biden's
demolition of our economy

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:50.033
with his crushing inflation.

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.501
They know that,
when we return to power,

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:55.067
we will bring their lies
and their corruption

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:58.067
and their disinformation
tumbling down.

00:02:58.067 --> 00:03:00.234
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:01.801
You have to keep him --
keep him focused.

00:03:01.801 --> 00:03:03.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.067
Hey, I saw that today is

00:03:07.067 --> 00:03:09.167
National Dentist's Day,
everybody.

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:10.534
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.501 --> 00:03:14.067
It's celebrated once a year,

00:03:14.067 --> 00:03:17.634
although dentists would prefer
once every six months.

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:19.834
Yep, 4 out of 5 dentists
celebrated today,

00:03:19.834 --> 00:03:21.334
while that one dentist
really can't

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.167
get on board with anything.

00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:24.300
Well, get this.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.300
There's a limited-edition
Girl Scouts Cookie

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:29.834
called the Raspberry Rally,
and it sold out so quickly

00:03:29.834 --> 00:03:33.267
that boxes are now being listed
on eBay for hundreds of dollars.

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:35.934
That's a great way for
Girl Scouts to earn their

00:03:35.934 --> 00:03:37.934
black-market badge.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.133
What's going in America?

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:42.467
You can buy legal weed
in a store,

00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:45.100
but you've got to go underground
for Girl Scout Cookies.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

